{"unit_id":"walvka-code__proj-doc-builder#card-zh","repo":"walvka-code/proj-doc-builder","commit":"fb983e9a254c0570c5a45c8de1c967e42e8844bd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"proj-doc-builder 是一个用于 DeepSeek Harness 的工程文档索引工具，也可作为项目技能或普通命令行工具使用。它通过 bundled skill provider 将技能挂入 DSH，并提供同步器和只读加载器。同步器扫描源码目录、维护内容哈希基线与文档 manifest，按变更生成工作清单，并支持校验后发布；加载器校验 manifest 后提供项目概览、单份文档或指定小节。适合希望让 AI 快速了解代码库、跟踪文档变化的开发者。命令行运行需要 Python 3.12+，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:31-36","index.js:118-163","skills/proj-doc-builder/tools/sync_project_docs.py:528-558","skills/proj-doc-builder/tools/sync_project_docs.py:3061-3204","skills/proj-doc-builder/tools/load_docs.py:63-93","skills/proj-doc-builder/tools/load_docs.py:133-214"]}
